#: src/libvlc-module.c:138
msgid ""
"You can completely disable the audio output. The audio decoding stage will "
"not take place, thus saving some processing power."
msgstr ""
"您可以完全关闭音频输出。音频解码步骤将不会进行，这样可以节省一些处理器资源。"

