#: modules/gui/macosx/VLCSimplePrefsController.m:441
msgid "Blu-ray menus"
msgstr "蓝光菜单"

#: modules/access/bluray.c:77
msgid ""
"Use Blu-ray menus. If disabled, the movie will start directly. Some discs "
"run their menus as a Java (BD-J) application that keeps one processor core "
"busy for as long as the disc is playing, so disabling menus can matter on an "
"older machine."
msgstr "使用蓝光菜单。若禁用，将直接开始播放影片。部分光盘以 Java (BD-J) 应用程序运行其菜单，在整个播放过程中会占用一个处理器核心，因此在较旧的机器上禁用菜单可能很有意义。"

#: modules/access/bluray.c:83
msgid "Region code"
msgstr "区域码"

#: modules/access/bluray.c:84
msgid ""
"Blu-Ray player region code. Some discs can be played only with a correct "
"region code."
msgstr "Blu-Ray 播放器的区域码。部分光盘只有在区域码正确时才可以播放。"

#: modules/access/bluray.c:86
msgid "Show forced subtitles"
msgstr "显示强制字幕"

#: modules/access/bluray.c:87
msgid ""
"When the disc hides the subtitle stream, keep decoding it and display only "
"its forced captions, as a standalone Blu-ray player does."
msgstr ""
"当光盘隐藏字幕流时，继续解码并仅显示其中的强制字幕，与独立蓝光播放机的行为一"
"致。"

#: modules/access/bluray.c:90
msgid "Use the main playlist from the key database"
msgstr "使用密钥数据库中的主播放列表"

#: modules/access/bluray.c:91
msgid ""
"Some discs hide the feature among hundreds of decoy playlists of the same "
"length, so the longest one is not the right one. When playing without menus, "
"start on the playlist your KEYDB.cfg records for this disc, if it records "
"one. Titles are named after their .mpls file either way, so another one can "
"still be picked."
msgstr ""
"某些光盘会把正片藏在数百个长度相同的诱饵播放列表中，因此最长的那个并不是正确"
"的。在无菜单播放时，如果您的 KEYDB.cfg 为该光盘记录了播放列表，则从该播放列表"
"开始播放。无论如何，标题都以其 .mpls 文件命名，因此仍可另选其他标题。"

