msgid ""
"If the cables between the satellilte low noise block-downconverter and the "
"receiver are long, higher voltage may be required.\n"
"Not all receivers support this."
msgstr ""
"如果卫星低噪降频转换器与接收器之间的电缆较长，可能需要更高的电压。\n"
"不是所有接收器都支持该功能。"

