msgid "Crystal HD acceleration"
msgstr "Crystal HD 加速"

#: modules/gui/macosx_crystalhd.m:555
msgid ""
"The bundled driver is 32-bit only, and this Mac is running a 64-bit kernel.\n"
"\n"
"Restart while holding the 3 and 2 keys to start a 32-bit kernel, then "
"install the driver."
msgstr ""
"随附的驱动程序仅为 32 位，而此 Mac 运行的是 64 位内核。\n"
"\n"
"请按住 3 和 2 键重新启动以进入 32 位内核，然后安装驱动程序。"

#: modules/gui/macosx_crystalhd.m:562
msgid ""
"The bundled driver is 32-bit only, and this version of macOS runs a 64-bit "
"kernel exclusively.\n"
"\n"
"The card cannot be used until a 64-bit driver is available."
msgstr ""
"随附的驱动程序仅为 32 位，而此版本的 macOS 只能以 64 位内核运行。\n"
"\n"
"在提供 64 位驱动程序之前，无法使用此卡。"

#: modules/gui/macosx_crystalhd.m:596
msgid ""
"PowerVLC found a Crystal HD card in this Mac. The card can decode H.264, "
"VC-1 and MPEG-2 video in hardware, which this Mac cannot do on its own.\n"
"\n"
"Using it needs a driver, which PowerVLC can install for you. You will be "
"asked for an administrator password."
msgstr ""
"PowerVLC 在此 Mac 中检测到 Crystal HD 卡。该卡可以硬件解码 H.264、VC-1 和 "
"MPEG-2 视频，而此 Mac 自身无法做到。\n"
"\n"
"使用它需要驱动程序，PowerVLC 可以为您安装。系统会要求输入管理员密码。"

#: modules/gui/macosx_crystalhd.m:602 modules/gui/macosx_crystalhd.m:687
msgid "Don't Ask Again"
msgstr "不再询问"

#: modules/gui/macosx_crystalhd.m:603
msgid "Not Now"
msgstr "以后再说"

#: modules/gui/macosx_crystalhd.m:617
msgid ""
"The Crystal HD driver is installed. Hardware acceleration will be used for "
"video that the card supports."
msgstr "Crystal HD 驱动程序已安装。此卡支持的视频将使用硬件加速。"

#: modules/gui/macosx_crystalhd.m:626
msgid ""
"Remove the Crystal HD driver from this Mac?\n"
"\n"
"Video will be decoded by the processor again. You will be asked for an "
"administrator password."
msgstr ""
"要从此 Mac 移除 Crystal HD 驱动程序吗？\n"
"\n"
"视频将重新由处理器解码。系统会要求输入管理员密码。"

#: modules/gui/macosx_crystalhd.m:629
#: modules/gui/legacy_macosx/VLCLegacyAudioEffects.m:709
