#: modules/gui/legacy_macosx/macosx.c:78
msgid "Legacy Mac OS X interface"
msgstr "旧版 Mac OS X 界面"

#: modules/gui/legacy_macosx/macosx.c:84 modules/gui/macosx/macosx.m:92
msgid "Run VLC with dark interface style"
msgstr "以深色界面风格运行 VLC"

#: modules/gui/legacy_macosx/macosx.c:85 modules/gui/macosx/macosx.m:93
msgid ""
"If this option is enabled, VLC will use the dark interface style. Otherwise, "
"the grey interface style is used."
msgstr "若启用本选项，VLC 将使用深色界面风格。否则将使用灰色界面风格。"

#: modules/gui/legacy_macosx/macosx.c:121 modules/gui/macosx/macosx.m:117
msgid "Shows the previous and next buttons in the main window."
msgstr "在主窗口中显示向前与向后按钮。"

#: modules/gui/legacy_macosx/macosx.c:125 modules/gui/macosx/macosx.m:120
msgid "Shows the shuffle and repeat buttons in the main window."
msgstr "在主窗口中显示 ｢随机｣ 与 ｢循环｣ 按钮。"

#: modules/gui/legacy_macosx/macosx.c:129 modules/gui/macosx/macosx.m:123
msgid "Shows the audio effects button in the main window."
msgstr "在主窗口显示音频效果按钮。"

#: modules/gui/legacy_macosx/macosx.c:135 modules/gui/macosx/macosx.m:136
msgid "Continue playback where you left off"
msgstr "从上次播放到的位置继续播放"

#: modules/gui/legacy_macosx/macosx.c:136 modules/gui/macosx/macosx.m:137
msgid ""
"VLC will store playback positions of the last 30 items you played. If you re-"
"open one of those, playback will continue."
msgstr ""
"VLC 会储存最近播放的 30 项所播放到的位置。重新打开其中任一项时，回放将从上次"
"播放到的位置继续。"

#: modules/gui/legacy_macosx/macosx.c:144 modules/gui/macosx/macosx.m:105
#: modules/gui/qt/qt.cpp:184
msgid ""
"With this option enabled, the playback will be automatically paused when "
"minimizing the window."
msgstr "启用本项后，最小化窗口时回放将自动暂停。"

#: modules/gui/legacy_macosx/macosx.c:148 modules/gui/macosx/macosx.m:139
#: modules/gui/qt/qt.cpp:200
msgid "Hide controls during playback"
msgstr "播放时隐藏控件"

#: modules/gui/legacy_macosx/macosx.c:149 modules/gui/macosx/macosx.m:140
#: modules/gui/qt/qt.cpp:201
msgid ""
"In windowed playback, hide the controls bar and the window title bar after a "
"few seconds once the mouse has left the window, leaving only the video. "
"Double-click the video to bring them back; keyboard shortcuts keep working "
"and show the fullscreen-style OSD meanwhile."
msgstr ""
"在窗口播放时，鼠标离开窗口几秒后自动隐藏控制栏和窗口标题栏，只保留视频画面。"
"双击视频即可恢复；键盘快捷键仍然有效，并显示与全屏模式相同的 OSD。"

#: modules/gui/legacy_macosx/macosx.c:167 modules/gui/macosx/macosx.m:143
#: modules/gui/qt/qt.cpp:204
msgid ""
"Render a small preview of the hovered position in the seek bar tooltip. The "
"preview is decoded by a second, silent input: on slow machines it can take "
"several seconds to appear and steal cycles from the playback; disable it "
"there."
msgstr ""
"在进度条的工具提示中显示所指位置的小预览图。预览由第二个静默输入解码：在较慢"
"的机器上可能需要数秒才能显示，并占用播放所需的资源；此时请禁用该功能。"

#: modules/gui/legacy_macosx/macosx.c:174 modules/gui/macosx/macosx.m:51
msgid "Video device"
msgstr "视频设备"

#: modules/gui/legacy_macosx/macosx.c:175 modules/gui/macosx/macosx.m:52
msgid ""
"Number of the screen to use by default to display videos in 'fullscreen'. "
"The screen number correspondance can be found in the video device selection "
"menu."
msgstr ""
"「全屏」模式默认用于显示视频的屏幕编号。屏幕编号可在视频设备选择菜单中找到。"

#: modules/gui/legacy_macosx/macosx.c:186
msgid "Embedded video in a child window"
msgstr "在子窗口中嵌入视频"

#: modules/gui/legacy_macosx/macosx.c:187
msgid ""
"Host the embedded video in a borderless child window: switching to "
"fullscreen is instant and does not interrupt accelerated decoding. Turning "
"this off restores the former behaviour (a separate fullscreen window). No "
"effect under Mac OS X 10.4, where a child window displays nothing."
msgstr ""
"将嵌入的视频置于无边框子窗口中：切换全屏是瞬时的，且不会中断加速解码。关闭后"
"将恢复原有行为 (独立的全屏窗口)。在 Mac OS X 10.4 上无效，该系统下子窗口不显"
"示任何内容。"

#: modules/gui/legacy_macosx/macosx.c:198
msgid "Open a window at startup (debugging)"
msgstr "启动时打开一个窗口 (调试)"

#: modules/gui/legacy_macosx/macosx.c:199
msgid ""
"Name of the window to open at startup, like the VLC_LEGACY_SHOW environment "
"variable: prefs, prefsadv, mediainfo, errors, about, bookmarks, messages, "
"tracksync, effects, videoeffects, convert, fspanel, open0..3."
msgstr ""
"启动时要打开的窗口名称，与环境变量 VLC_LEGACY_SHOW 相同：prefs、prefsadv、"
"mediainfo、errors、about、bookmarks、messages、tracksync、effects、"
"videoeffects、convert、fspanel、open0..3。"

#: modules/gui/legacy_macosx/macosx.c:207 modules/gui/macosx/macosx.m:61
msgid "In fullscreen mode, keep screen where there is no video displayed black"
msgstr "在全屏模式中，保持没有显示视频的地方为黑色"

#: modules/gui/legacy_macosx/macosx.c:215 modules/gui/macosx/macosx.m:77
msgid "By default, VLC can be remotely controlled with the Apple Remote."
msgstr "默认情况下，VLC 可以使用 Apple Remote 远程操控。"

#: modules/gui/legacy_macosx/macosx.c:220 modules/gui/macosx/macosx.m:80
msgid ""
"By default, VLC will control its own volume with the Apple Remote. However, "
"you can choose to control the global system volume instead."
msgstr ""
"VLC 默认通过 Apple Remote 控制软件自身的音量。但您可以选择改为控制全局系统音"
"量。"

#: modules/gui/legacy_macosx/macosx.c:226 modules/gui/macosx/macosx.m:89
msgid ""
"By default, VLC can be controlled using the media keys on modern Apple "
"keyboards."
msgstr "默认情况下，VLC 可以使用现代 Apple 键盘的媒体按键操控。"

#: modules/gui/legacy_macosx/macosx.c:231 modules/gui/macosx/macosx.m:126
msgid "VLC will pause and resume supported music players on playback."
msgstr "VLC 将在回放时暂停/恢复受支持的音乐播放器。"

#: modules/gui/legacy_macosx/macosx.c:251
msgid ""
"Removes the interlacing combing from interlaced video such as most PAL DVDs. "
"Higher settings look better but use more CPU. \"Best quality\" is offered "
"only on Macs fast enough for it (G5, Intel, Apple Silicon), exactly as "
"Apple's DVD Player greys it out on slower models."
msgstr ""
"去除隔行视频（如大多数 PAL 制式 DVD）的梳状条纹。设置越高画面越好，但占用更"
"多 CPU。“极佳质量”仅在足够快的 Mac（G5、Intel、Apple 芯片）上提供，正如 "
"Apple 的 DVD 播放程序在较慢机型上将其变灰一样。"

#: modules/gui/legacy_macosx/misc.m:725 modules/gui/macosx/VLCMain.m:239
msgid ""
"You are currently using PowerVLC, an open source fork with no ads and no "
"tracking, created independently by Olsro for the community and distributed "
"freely. This derivative version would not exist without VLC itself, so out "
"of respect I have chosen to keep all the links and buttons referring to "
"VideoLAN, as well as the list of contributors.\n"
"\n"
"To support me, I have a Patreon ( https://www.patreon.com/Olsro/ ) where I "
"accept your donations. You can find me on GitHub ( https://github.com/"
"Olsro ) and I invite you to share PowerVLC and to leave positive and/or "
"constructive feedback if this project matters to you in your life.\n"
"\n"
"Please do not bother VideoLAN with bug reports and support requests, as this "
"fork is absolutely unofficial and not supported by VideoLAN.\n"
"\n"
"By clicking \"Yes\", you will be redirected to the requested link."
msgstr ""
"您当前使用的是 PowerVLC，这是一个无广告、无跟踪的开源分支，由 Olsro 独立为社"
"区创建并自由分发。没有 VLC 本身就不会有这个衍生版本，因此出于敬意，我选择保留"
"所有指向 VideoLAN 的链接和按钮，以及贡献者名单。\n"
"\n"
"如需支持我，我有一个 Patreon（ https://www.patreon.com/Olsro/ ）接受您的捐"
"助。您可以在 GitHub（ https://github.com/Olsro ）上找到我。如果这个项目对您的"
"生活有意义，欢迎分享 PowerVLC 并留下积极和/或建设性的反馈。\n"
"\n"
"本分支完全非官方，VideoLAN 不提供支持，请勿以缺陷报告和支持请求打扰 "
"VideoLAN。\n"
"\n"
"点击“是”后，您将被重定向到所请求的链接。"

